that the Treaty for Austria shall provide that Austria shall guarantee the
                        protection of the rights of Slovene and Croat national minorities in
                        Austria;

that reparations shall not be exacted from Austria, but that Yugoslavia
                        shall have the right to seize, retain or liquidate the Austrian property,
                        rights and interests on Yugoslav territory;

that the disputes which might arise in the application of the provisions
                        of the article concerning the German assets in Austria must be settled on
                        the basis of bilateral negotiations between the interested parties;
